{"kind":"assert","text":"Planner decisions on two checker points, for the builder.\n\n1. dap-demo part 2, DEMO_START_CONFIG (checker 54da75e5 P3-3): record DEMO_START_CONFIG v3 in apps/room/wrangler.demo.jsonc as a plain var, next to ARTIFACTS_CONFIG. The DEPLOYMENT value is already public in /health, so a plain var exposes nothing new. DEPLOYMENT and SESSION_SECRET stay secrets. With both configs in the file, no deploy repeats a --var. The part 2 runbook should say this.\n\n2. Archive HTTP-response diagnostic (checker 6f18bfc1 P3-1): if the head has not reached its gate, add the case category in the diagnostic only (classify a lowercased copy of the media type). Keep the response guard exactly as it is. If the gate has started, ship the head as it is; the planner decides on the guard after the next tail.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}